        "original_id": "b6cb1a57-e363-560c-8c76-56c397e719c4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, David Shore, Daniel Dae Kim, Yunjin Kim\n- TV Series: The Good Doctor, Lost, The Whole Truth\n- Companies: ABC, 3AD\n- Roles: Dr. Glassman, Sun Kwon, Jin Kwon\n- Places: San José, California, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, the South Korean series that inspired The Good Doctor was released.\n- The Good Doctor is an American medical-drama television series developed by David Shore and based on the 2013 South Korean series of the same name.\n- Daniel Dae Kim runs the film and television production company 3AD, which is producing The Good Doctor.\n- In September 2017, Richard Schiff began appearing in a leading role on ABC's prime time drama series The Good Doctor as Dr. Glassman, the president of a fictional teaching hospital in San José, California.\n- In the Lost episode The Whole Truth, flashbacks feature Sun Kwon, played by Yunjin Kim, and revolve around fertility problems involving Sun Kwon and Jin Kwon, played by Daniel Dae Kim.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
